sanīyā dhammā,","Uddiṭṭhā aṭṭha pāṭidesanīyā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā aṭṭha pāṭidesanīyā dhammā"],["pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.7","Uddiṭṭhā sekhiyā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā sekhiyā dhammā,","Uddiṭṭhā sekhiyā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā sekhiyā dhammā"],["pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.8","Uddiṭṭhā satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā,","Uddiṭṭhā satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā.","uddiṭṭhā satta adhikaraṇasamathā dhammā."],["pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.9","Ettakaṁ tassa bhagavato suttāgataṁ suttapariyāpannaṁ anvaddhamāsaṁ uddesaṁ āgacchati.","ettakaṃ tassa bhagavato suttāgataṃ suttapariyāpannaṃ anvaddhamāsaṃ uddesaṃ āgacchati.","Ettakaṃ tassa bhagavato suttāgataṃ suttapariyāpannaṃ anvaddhamāsaṃ uddesaṃ āgacchati.","ettakantassa bhagavato suttāgataṃ suttapariyāpannaṃ anvaḍḍhamāsaṃ uddesaṃ āgacchati."],["pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.10","Tattha sabbāheva samaggāhi sammodamānāhi avivadamānāhi sikkhitabbanti.","tattha sabbāheva samaggāhi sammodamānāhi avivadamānāhi sikkhitabbanti.","Tattha sabbāheva samaggāhi sammodamānāhi avivadamānāhi sikkhitabbanti.","tattha sabbāheva samaggāhi sammodamānāhi avivadamānāhi sikkhitabbanti."],["pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.11","Bhikkhunivibhaṅgo niṭṭhito.","bhikkhunīvibhaṅgo niṭṭhito.","Bhikkhunivibhaṅgo niṭṭhito.","bhikkhunīvibhaṅgo niṭṭhito."],["pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:5.1","Pācittiyapāḷi niṭṭhitā.","pācittiyapāḷi niṭṭhitā.","Pācittiyapāḷi niṭṭhitā.",""]],"var":{"th":{"pli-tv-bi-vb-as3:1.1":"paṭiññātakaraṇaṃ → yu. ma. paṭiññāya kāretabbaṃ.","pli-tv-bi-vb-as6:1.1":"tassapāpiyasikā → yu. ma. tassapāpiyyasikā."}},"ref":{"bjt":{"pli-tv-bi-vb-as1:2.1":"para1","pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:2.1":"para2","pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.1":"para3"},"my":{"pli-tv-bi-vb-as1:2.1":"para1242, T0.0267, P4.0351, V0.0488"},"th":{"pli-tv-bi-vb-as1:1.1":"sya3.267, para503","pli-tv-bi-vb-as7:4.1":"para504"}}}]}